@startuml
title Mitigated authentication and owner-scoped note flow

actor "Browser user" as User
participant "Server-rendered web app" as App
participant "Authentication and session controls" as Security
database "SQLite demonstration database" as DB
collections "Environment key source" as KeySource

== Registration ==
User -> App : Registration form and signed double-submit CSRF token
App -> Security : Validate request size, fields, password policy, pre-auth CSRF
Security -> Security : Argon2id password hash
Security -> DB : Store normalized identity and password hash
Security -> DB : Record registration audit event
App --> User : Generic success or validation response

== Login ==
User -> App : Credentials
App -> Security : Check account and client-address attempt limits
Security -> DB : Load account and lockout state
Security -> Security : Verify Argon2id hash or dummy hash
alt Login accepted
  Security -> Security : Generate opaque session token and CSRF secret
  Security -> DB : Store session/CSRF hashes, timestamps, absolute expiry
  Security -> DB : Record successful login
  App --> User : HttpOnly, SameSite cookies; Secure in production mode
else Login rejected
  Security -> DB : Increment bounded failure state and record failure
  App --> User : Generic invalid-credentials response
end

== Protected request ==
User -> App : Session cookie and request
App -> Security : Hash token; validate revocation, idle and absolute expiry
Security -> DB : Rotate/update server-side session state when required

== Create or update note ==
User -> App : Form body and CSRF token
App -> Security : Validate CSRF, body size, title/body limits, quota
App -> DB : Query note by public UUID and authenticated owner ID
App -> KeySource : Load configured 32-byte key
App -> App : AES-GCM encrypt title/body with unique nonces and bound AAD
App -> DB : Insert or update ciphertext and key version
App -> DB : Record metadata-only audit event
App --> User : Escaped server-rendered page

== Read, list, and export ==
User -> App : Note/list/export request
App -> DB : Query only rows owned by authenticated user; paginate listing
DB --> App : Ciphertext rows
App -> KeySource : Load key
App -> App : Authenticate and decrypt selected fields
App --> User : Escaped HTML or user-scoped download

== Delete ==
User -> App : Confirmed POST with CSRF token
App -> DB : Delete by public UUID and authenticated owner ID
App -> DB : Record deletion audit event
App --> User : Generic result

== Logout ==
User -> App : POST logout with CSRF token
App -> DB : Revoke hashed session
App -> DB : Record logout
App --> User : Expire cookie
@enduml
